    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_editing_heading">Editing</string>
    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_editing">G + swipe — Move the cursor in any direction\nShift + G + swipe — Select text; reverse to shrink\nZ ↖ — Select all\nX ↖ / C ↖ / V ↖ — Cut / Copy / Paste\nBackspace ← — Delete the previous word\nHold Backspace, then drag ← — Preview a larger word or sentence deletion; reverse to shrink, release to delete</string>
    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_space_heading">Spacebar</string>
    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_space">Space ↖ — Clipboard\nSpace ↗ — Everyday / Coding mode\nSpace ↙ — Emoji\nSpace ↘ — GIF</string>
    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_learning_heading">Adaptive learning</string>
    <string name="launcher_shortcuts_learning">Letter ↑ — Review whether to keep or replace the current word\nLetter ↓ — Forget the current word\nType the same unknown pattern three times in one editor session — Review whether to keep it or save a replacement\nCorrect the same typo to the same word four times — Make that exact correction the strongest recall, including supported two-edit corrections</string>

